{
  "id": "RAW_07cd83a89c",
  "title": "用 Agent Plan 解锁 AI 导演体验：通过 CUA 搭 Blender 白模指导武侠视频生成",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247522909&idx=1&sn=82ca1c732c0de74e3530284c6c4df3f1",
  "date": "2026-10-08 19:02:00",
  "author": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "siteName": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>Agent&nbsp;Plan</span> <span>2026-10-08 19:02</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261008155111_78b8dde.jpeg\"></p>\n  <div style=\"padding:0px 8px;font-weight:400;font-size:15px;line-height:2;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>用 AI 直接生成一段带动作和运镜的视频，最容易卡住的地方是：动作和镜头对不上你想要的效果。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>提示词里写 &nbsp;\"360 度环绕镜头\"\" 第 7 秒主角撩剑反击 \"，模型往往给不出稳定结果 —— 动作节点偏移、镜头节奏随机、分镜顺序漂移，多调几轮提示词也未必收敛。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>这篇文章想分享的是我们在实践中跑通的一条思路：使用 Agent Plan 中的专属 Harness —— CUA（Computer Use Agent），操作最近火热的 Blender，零门槛将一句武侠创意转化为白模预演和可控的视频成片。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>思路其实很像真正的导演拍片：先把人物关键动作、运镜轨迹定下来，Blender 白模则提供了这样的三维空间。再把这段白模视频作为参考喂给生视频模型。火山方舟 Agent Plan 套餐覆盖全流程所需的模型及Harness，由 Agent 自动操控云桌面中的 Blender，从创意构思、白模搭建，到一键生成电影感成片，全程无需专业基础，纯小白也能解锁 AI 导演体验。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(2, 116, 255);border-radius: 12px;overflow: hidden;padding: 20px;height: auto;box-shadow: rgba(2, 116, 255, 0.11) 6px 6px 0px 0px;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>核心亮点：</span></span></strong></p>\n      <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>CUA操作Blender简单易用：</span></span></strong><span>让 Agent 直接使用云桌面中的专业三维软件，串联建模、动画、运镜和渲染，</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><span>0门槛白模视频制作</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>。</span></span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>全模态模型及专属 Harness升级：</span></span></strong><span>Agent Plan套餐支持多模态模型，集成</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><span>字节SOTA级 Seedance、Seedream 生图生视频模型</span></span></strong><span>能力，串联从创意构思、动作设计到视频成片的完整流程。</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>兼容主流工具：</span></span></strong><span>多生态兼容，无缝接入 Claude Code、Codex等</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><span>主流编程及 Agent 工具</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>。</span></span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>用量清晰可查：</span></span></strong><span>采用 Agent 燃料值（AFP）作为统一用量单位，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\"><span>额度用量清晰可查</span></span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>。</span></span></p>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>下面我们用一个武侠主题的视频生成案例，完整展现从创意到 20 秒武侠成片的全过程。</span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>下面我们用一个武侠主题的视频生成案例，完整展现从创意到 20 秒武侠成片的全过程。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>一、视频生成案例</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>本案例选的题材是 \"武当山之巅，两位武者交手\"，展示&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>20 秒白模预演、3 张角色／场景参考图、20 秒武侠成片及对照视频。</span></span></strong><span>下文保留了实际使用的各阶段的提示词与演示素材，可按顺序一步步复现。</span></p>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>本文中的“白模”指的是以简化几何体和基础材质表达动作、空间与镜头的预演；也可以用不同颜色区分角色，无需先完成精细人物建模。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>「核心使用能力」：</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261008155111_741ca68.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>二、前置准备</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Step1：开通 Agent Plan 并准备Computer Use Agent 环境</span></strong></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>（1）</span></span><strong style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>购买套餐：请登陆</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>「</span></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>火山方舟</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>」（</span></span><span><a href=\"https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:cn-beijing/openManagementLLM=%7B%7D&amp;OpenModelVisible=false&amp;advancedActiveKey=agentPlan）\" target=\"_blank\">https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:cn-beijing/openManagementLLM=%7B%7D&amp;OpenModelVisible=false&amp;advancedActiveKey=agentPlan）</a></span><span style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>或 「</span></span><strong style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>官网活动页</span></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>」（<a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/activity/agentplan）\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.volcengine.com/activity/agentplan）</a></span></span></p>\n      <p style=\"text-align: left;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>购买 Agent Plan 套餐。购买</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>&nbsp;Medium 及以上套餐</span></span></strong><span>即可开启使用套餐内专属 Harness 工具—— &nbsp; Computer Use Agent。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n        <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>请注意，仅large及以上套餐支持seedance模型</span></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261008155111_88314ff.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>（2）安装 Computer use Agent：</span></span></strong><span>参考官方文档：<a href=\"https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/82379/2670601?lang=zh\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/82379/2670601?lang=zh</a></span></p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>（3）配置 Agent Plan 套餐模型：</span></span></strong><span>您可通过以下两种方式进行安装</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n     <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>方式1: 一键安装：</span></span></strong><span>推荐使用 ArkCLI 一键安装模型及Harness，1分钟帮你的 Agent 一键安装 Agent Plan。</span></p>\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>○具体教程可见</span><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>官方指南</span></span><span>（<a href=\"https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/agent-plan-personal-ark-cli?lang=zh）\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/agent-plan-personal-ark-cli?lang=zh）</a></span></p>\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>方式2: 手动配置：</span></span></strong></p>\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>○&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span>需要获取 Agent Plan 支持的专属 Base URL、专属 API Key及模型配置，才能正常使用并抵扣套餐额度。</span></p>\n      </li>\n     </ul>\n     <p></p>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>方式1: 自动化配置 (推荐)</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-start;border-radius:10px;padding:24px 21px;box-shadow:rgb(255, 255, 250) 1px 1px 5px 0px;overflow:hidden;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-block;width:100%;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>配置项</span></strong></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>ArkCLI -一键配置模型及 harness</span></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>截图示意</span></strong></p>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261008155111_79012b9.png\"></p>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>说明</span></strong></p>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>ArkCLI</span></span><span>&nbsp;（<a href=\"https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/agent-plan-personal-ark-cli?lang=zh）Helper\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/agent-plan-personal-ark-cli?lang=zh）Helper</a> 是一个编码工具助手，支持快速配置选择的工具接入 Agent Plan。安装并运行该助手，根据界面提示操作可自动完成工具配置，降低手动配置的时间成本和出错风险。</span></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>方式2: 手动配置</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-start;border-radius:10px;padding:24px 21px;box-shadow:rgb(255, 255, 250) 1px 1px 5px 0px;overflow:hidden;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-block;width:100%;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>配置项</span></strong></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>配置模型及专属 Base URL</span></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>截图示意</span></strong></p>\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;